        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial opportunity could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are viewed as safer, more effective or less expensive than any products that we may develop.",
